街の灯り
The lights of the town

390
00:32:50,148 --> 00:32:54,348
手を叩いて ほら 二人 見惚れて
Clapping our hands, look, the two of us are spellbound

391
00:32:54,348 --> 00:32:56,548
終わりのない朝
A morning with no end

392
00:32:56,548 --> 00:33:00,048
不意違い 踏み付けにはう
Clumsily stepping on each other—

393
00:33:00,048 --> 00:33:01,348
それは
that's

394
00:33:01,348 --> 00:33:06,548
ひらひら 踊れ 踊れ
fluttering, dance, dance!

395
